{"id":"1e5b452405bef2657d0123711b18909bf6d2a537","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230224","title":"大佬们，在 Claude Code 中使用 GLM5.2 效果怎么样？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"keepongjl","excerpt":"程序员 - @keepongjl - 和 Claude Code 原生的比着怎么样？Codex 呢？Codex 开通会员的话，折腾几下。想着是不是先开通 glm 140 的套餐试试","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>和 Claude Code 原生的比着怎么样？</p>\n<p>Codex 呢？</p>\n<p>Codex 开通会员的话，折腾几下。想着是不是先开通 glm 140 的套餐试试</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909510\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/68bd46e19f2b1d1d7df3fa04bba0ac19?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"LOGOSJ\" data-uid=\"654834\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LOGOSJ\">LOGOSJ</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 20:16:36 +08:00\">22h 36m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>套餐不好抢啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909527\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 20:24:17 +08:00\">22h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很强，第一个真能平替 claude 的国模（后面还有更弱点的 qwen37max 和更强一点的 kimi k3 ） by 我司几千号人用自己的配额用量认证</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909538\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 20:28:48 +08:00\">22h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>更正下上面说的，qwen37max 在 glm5.2 之前，比 glm5.1 强（同样是用配额投票），但这俩当时公司内的用量都没超过 opus 。后来的 glm5.2 和 k3 是真的卷赢了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909553\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c476/56f5/269732_normal.png?m=1746689710\" alt=\"mmdsun\" data-uid=\"269732\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mmdsun\">mmdsun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 20:36:00 +08:00\">22h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很慢、思考开 max 有点厉害 但速度太慢了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b36/82b4/585272_normal.png?m=1781489630\" alt=\"kphiia\" data-uid=\"585272\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kphiia\">kphiia</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 23:38:09 +08:00\">19h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很好用，但非常慢，有史以来最慢的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 09:50:52 +08:00\">9h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a> 我这边类似感受。glm5.2 之前，qwen3.7max 是接近 opus4.X 的国模。<br>glm5.2 则是真平替</p><p>不过这几天高强度用下来，个人感受，qwen3.8max 比 glm5.2 强一些..</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910864\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4ad4/d043/590881_normal.png?m=1660132671\" alt=\"YepTen\" data-uid=\"590881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YepTen\">YepTen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 10:10:26 +08:00\">8h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以买第三方的 coding plan 比如火山方舟的 能使用 glm-5.2</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910947\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a418/0f47/578202_normal.png?m=1768979858\" alt=\"s1mpleo\" data-uid=\"578202\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/s1mpleo\">s1mpleo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 10:18:47 +08:00\">8h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的 claude 总是在乱想，一个简单的问题磨蹭很久，glm5.2 也是</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17911016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a087/1963/186098_normal.png?m=1646968527\" alt=\"xooass\" data-uid=\"186098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xooass\">xooass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 10:27:34 +08:00\">8h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>只要 codex 还在做老好人，感觉就没啥必要</p><p>但是前端我是真想试试 k3</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17911451\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a5a3/c886/351876_normal.png?m=1735204312\" alt=\"rrZ2C\" data-uid=\"351876\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rrZ2C\">rrZ2C</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 11:17:54 +08:00\">7h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>慢+思考长；一旦扯上 ui 逻辑混乱；</p><p>代码逻辑强，上下文不会丢失核心代码逻辑；</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912100\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravat